### UniSchool API: try it from IntelliJ (open this file and click the green arrows).
### Start the app first (run UniSchool). Every demo password is "unischool".

### 1. Sign in as Naledi (parent of Lerato and Thabo)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "naledi", "password": "unischool"}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}

### Home screen: wallet, unread notices, "ready for next year" checklist
GET http://localhost:8081/api/home
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Children with wallets and card controls
GET http://localhost:8081/api/learners
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Freeze Thabo's card and raise his daily limit (use Thabo's id from the list above)
PATCH http://localhost:8081/api/learners/3/controls
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"frozen": true, "dailyLimit": 100}

### Tuckshop week for both children
GET http://localhost:8081/api/tuckshop/week
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Shop: uniform for Lerato, tailored to her sizes
GET http://localhost:8081/api/shop/catalog?learnerId=2&category=UNIFORM
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Notices for the children
GET http://localhost:8081/api/notices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Trips, events and levies
GET http://localhost:8081/api/payments/collections
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Tuckshop till: sign in as Grace
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "sithole", "password": "unischool"}

> {% client.global.set("till", response.body.token); %}

### Today's pre-orders and sales
GET http://localhost:8081/api/pos/today
Authorization: Bearer {{till}}

### Try to sell Lerato a muffin (declined: she's on pre-orders only)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/pos/charge
Authorization: Bearer {{till}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"learnerId": 2, "menuItemIds": [9]}

### 3. Principal: sign in as Thandeka
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "khumalo", "password": "unischool"}

> {% client.global.set("principal", response.body.token); %}

### School at a glance, with drafts waiting for approval
GET http://localhost:8081/api/principal/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{principal}}

### Switch to the school-office role on the same account
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/switch-role
Authorization: Bearer {{principal}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"role": "SCHOOL_OFFICE"}

> {% client.global.set("office", response.body.token); %}

### School office overview
GET http://localhost:8081/api/school/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{office}}
